{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"Leaf watches with wide eyes as Eselein fades away, looking at the cauldron in amazement for a moment. She turns back to Selene smiling. \"That was amazing! You're amazing Selene!\" She stops to yawn. \"Yeah, it's probably time for bed. Goodnight!\" She smiles to them before finding her own tree to sleep under, preferring one close to the water.","created_at":"2020-08-04T07:42:11.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740112334911176736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
