{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"Leaf can't help but smile at finding someone new to sleep under the stars with. She lays down in the grass and holds her holy symbol up in the air in front of her, looking it over with the night sky as a back light. Silently she prays, ||Hi Mello. I'm really sorry I didn't visit today. I wanted to then something really bad happened... I wasn't sure if I was going to be alright. And then things worked out somehow. Not really sure how, but they did. Don't suppose you had anything to do with it? Oh, that reminds me! I have to show the box I got this morning to Florian! Sorry Mello. I know I'm probably keeping you up. It's just that a lot happened today...|| She continues silently rambling to her best friend Mello until she falls asleep.","created_at":"2020-08-04T07:58:58.838000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740116560978509876","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"wakes up and looks around.... seeing people sleeping he quietly goes about following Web's advice on moss maintenance away from where Leaf fell asleep.  After a bit, he heads into town.","created_at":"2020-08-04T12:11:57.472000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740180224783941732","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
